From d008c9d35b72ca74e5ec2d24ac14699613c46fd4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: charles <gzcheng0822@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 07:38:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: sprd_wlan_combo: SC2355 block-ack rearm and nonblocking
 admission

Per-peer BA ownership (ba_lock, generations, pending/rearm) so that BA
negotiation recovers across topology changes, failures and cancelled work.
Adapted from e5-linux devices/common/wifi-ba.py (kanoqwq, 2026-10-30).
